ChatGPT analysis revealed that the patient reflects on his struggles with ME/CFS, its severity and profound impact on individuals’ lives. Additionally, it suggests the patient’s strong interest in disseminating information and sharing personal experiences related to ME/CFS, thereby contributing to ongoing research efforts (
